Subject: [PATCH] Include the minimal hairpin branch in WIP splits

V(k,j) is valid when j-k-1 == TURN. Include that endpoint in
partition-function and MFE forward/traceback WIP scans. Sampling
already uses k < j-TURN; no sampling changes are included.

--- a/src/part_func.cc
+++ b/src/part_func.cc
@@ -471,3 +471,3 @@
     contributions += get_energy_WMB(i, j) * expbp_penalty * expPSM_penalty;
-    for (cand_pos_t k = i + 1; k < j - TURN - 1; ++k) {
+    for (cand_pos_t k = i + 1; k <= j - TURN - 1; ++k) {
         bool can_pair = tree.up[k - 1] >= (k - i);
